OL,3,GNEWSAFear and anxiety amid rise in
OL,4,Areligious hate crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FReligious communities are facing "fear
OL,7,Fand anxiety" amid a surge in reports of
OL,8,Fanti-Muslim and antisemitic hate
OL,9,Fcrimes.
OL,11,FReports of crimes across the Avon and
OL,12,FSomerset Police area targeting Muslim
OL,13,Fpeople have risen by 240% between 2022
OL,14,Fand 2025, while those targeting Jewish
OL,15,Fpeople have increased by 163% over the
OL,16,Fsame period.
OL,18,FProfessor Adeela Shafi from the Bristol
OL,19,FMuslim Strategic Leadership Group said
OL,20,Fthe figures, uncovered by a BBC Freedom
OL,21,Fof Information (FOI) request, were
OL,22,F"startling".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
