OL,3,GNEWSAFear and anxiety amid rise in
OL,4,Areligious hate crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police spokesperson said there was
OL,7,F"absolutely no place for hate,
OL,8,Fintimidation or violence in Avon and
OL,9,FSomerset", and urged victims to report
OL,10,Fincidents to police.
